graph TD
    subgraph "Redis Sentinel Cluster"
        S1[Sentinel 1]
        S2[Sentinel 2]
        S3[Sentinel 3]
    end

    subgraph "Redis Servers"
        M[Master]
        R1[Replica 1]
        R2[Replica 2]
    end

    S1 -->|Monitor| M
    S1 -->|Monitor| R1
    S1 -->|Monitor| R2

    S2 -->|Monitor| M
    S2 -->|Monitor| R1
    S2 -->|Monitor| R2

    S3 -->|Monitor| M
    S3 -->|Monitor| R1
    S3 -->|Monitor| R2

    M -->|Replicate| R1
    M -->|Replicate| R2

    Client[Clients] -->|Connect via| S1
    Client -->|Connect via| S2
    Client -->|Connect via| S3